{"4367700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Postman Cometh", "steam_appid": 4367700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4367700/extras/78ed0fd0866f3f89dce82ee05cf0b04e.poster.avif?t=1782332932\" width=780 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4367700/extras/78ed0fd0866f3f89dce82ee05cf0b04e.webm?t=1782332932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4367700/extras/78ed0fd0866f3f89dce82ee05cf0b04e.mp4?t=1782332932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE POSTMAN COMETH</strong> is a cozy first-person comedy game about delivering mail in a strange little town. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While stranded in the middle of nowhere, you take on a temporary job as the town’s postman. Each day, you’ll explore the town, deliver letters and odd packages, and talk to a cast of colorful villagers while uncovering the truth behind the dissapearance of the previous postman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4367700/extras/088f05cfb992c643f32ac8aad81a026a.poster.avif?t=1782332932\" width=780 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4367700/extras/088f05cfb992c643f32ac8aad81a026a.webm?t=1782332932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4367700/extras/088f05cfb992c643f32ac8aad81a026a.mp4?t=1782332932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></